          "# Model Name\n## Model Details\n- Architecture: BERT\n- Pre-trained on: Wikipedia + BookCorpus\n\n## Intended Use\nThis model is intended for sentiment analysis on movie reviews.\n\n## Performance\n- Accuracy: 94.2%\n- F1-score: 0.93\n\n## Limitations\n- Trained on English text only\n- May not work well on specialized domains\n\n## Ethical Considerations\nThis model can perpetuate social biases present in training data.\n\n## Training Data\nModel trained on 500K movie reviews from IMDb.\n\n## How to use"
